graph TD
    User[User] -->|HTTPS| Frontend[Web Frontend (Next.js)]
    Frontend -->|REST / SSE| Backend[Backend API (FastAPI)]

    subgraph Data_Storage [Data Storage]
        Postgres[(PostgreSQL)]
        Vespa[(Vespa Vector DB)]
        Redis[(Redis Cache/Broker)]
        MinIO[(MinIO Object Store)]
    end

    subgraph Background_Workers [Celery Workers]
        PrimaryWorker[Primary Worker]
        DocFetching[DocFetching Worker]
        DocProcessing[DocProcessing Worker]
        LightWorker[Light Worker]
        HeavyWorker[Heavy Worker]
    end

    subgraph Inference [Inference Services]
        ModelServer[Model Server (Bi/Cross-Encoders)]
        LLM[External LLM (OpenAI/Anthropic/etc)]
    end

    subgraph External_Sources [External Data Sources]
        GoogleDrive[Google Drive]
        Slack[Slack]
        Web[Websites]
        Confluence[Confluence]
        etc[etc...]
    end

    %% Backend Interactions
    Backend -->|Read/Write| Postgres
    Backend -->|Cache/PubSub| Redis
    Backend -->|Query/Search| Vespa
    Backend -->|Chat Generation| LLM
    Backend -->|Dispatch Tasks| Redis

    %% Worker Interactions
    Redis -->|Consume Tasks| PrimaryWorker
    Redis -->|Consume Tasks| DocFetching
    Redis -->|Consume Tasks| DocProcessing
    Redis -->|Consume Tasks| LightWorker
    Redis -->|Consume Tasks| HeavyWorker

    %% DocFetching Flow
    DocFetching -->|Fetch Data| External_Sources
    DocFetching -->|Store Batches| MinIO
    DocFetching -->|Update State| Postgres
    DocFetching -.->|Spawns Process| IsolatedProcess[Isolated Connector Process]

    %% DocProcessing Flow
    DocProcessing -->|Read Batches| MinIO
    DocProcessing -->|Embed Chunks| ModelServer
    DocProcessing -->|Index Docs| Vespa
    DocProcessing -->|Update Metadata| Postgres
    DocProcessing -->|Summarize/Context| LLM

    %% General Worker Interactions
    PrimaryWorker -->|Coordination| Postgres
    PrimaryWorker -->|Schedule| Redis
    LightWorker -->|Permissions Sync| Postgres
    LightWorker -->|Update ACLs| Vespa
    HeavyWorker -->|Pruning| Vespa
    HeavyWorker -->|Pruning| Postgres

    %% Model Server
    ModelServer -->|Embeddings| DocProcessing
    ModelServer -->|Reranking| Backend

    %% Styling
    classDef storage fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef worker fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef external fill:#ddd,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    class Postgres,Vespa,Redis,MinIO storage;
    class PrimaryWorker,DocFetching,DocProcessing,LightWorker,HeavyWorker worker;
    class GoogleDrive,Slack,Web,Confluence,etc,LLM external;
